-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §41 שעות תפקיד לרכז מקצוע: from תשע"ב the
-- school principal allots a subject coordinator role hours in place of his
-- frontal teaching hours, out of one basket for all the school's subject
-- coordinators together — half an hour for each class of the upper grades
-- the school counts — and no coordinator more than one hour of it. Part י
-- speaks of every teaching employee; §17's table sends the subject
-- coordinator's role hours here.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-2`

§ `41 שעות תפקיד לרכז מקצוע`

DECLARE `Oz section 41 action` IS ONE OF
    `allot the subject coordinators role hours out of the basket`
    `allot one subject coordinator more than an hour out of the basket`

-- ¶1: from the school year תשע"ב (convention dates.school-year).
@ref akn:art_41
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 41 allots role hours in` y IF
    y AT LEAST `the school year 5772`

-- ¶1: the basket is half an hour for each class of grades ט'–י"ב, and
-- י"ג–י"ד where the school has them, in a four-year school; of grades
-- י'–י"ב (י"ג–י"ד) in a three-year or a six-year school. A school of another
-- kind is no school of the agreement (§§2, 4(ח)) and has no basket.
@ref akn:art_41
GIVEN k IS A `kind of Oz school`
      `classes in grade 9` IS A NUMBER
      `classes in grades 10 to 14` IS A NUMBER @desc grades י'–י"ב, and י"ג–י"ד where the school has them
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the subject coordinators' basket of role hours` k `classes in grade 9` `classes in grades 10 to 14` IS
    `half an hour a class` TIMES counted
    WHERE
        `half an hour a class` MEANS 0.5
        counted MEANS
            CONSIDER k
            WHEN `a four-year school, grades 9 to 12` THEN `classes in grade 9` PLUS `classes in grades 10 to 14`
            WHEN `a three-year school, grades 10 to 12` THEN `classes in grades 10 to 14`
            WHEN `a six-year school, grades 7 to 12` THEN `classes in grades 10 to 14`
            WHEN `a school of another kind` THEN 0

-- ¶1: the principal allots the role hours out of the basket (no deadline:
-- convention dates.no-deadline); they take the place of the coordinator's
-- frontal teaching hours.
@ref akn:art_41
`allotting the subject coordinators' role hours` MEANS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MUST  `allot the subject coordinators role hours out of the basket`

-- ¶2: no single subject coordinator is allotted more than one hour out of
-- the basket ("לא ... יותר משעה אחת": an hour is in).
@ref akn:art_41/p2
`the most a subject coordinator is allotted out of the basket` MEANS 1

`allotting one coordinator more than an hour` MEANS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    SHANT `allot one subject coordinator more than an hour out of the basket`

-- An allotment keeps to the section: no coordinator more than an hour,
-- none less than nothing, and all of them together within the basket.
GIVEN basket IS A NUMBER
      allotted IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an allotment within section 41` basket allotted IF
        all (GIVEN h YIELD h AT LEAST 0 AND h AT MOST `the most a subject coordinator is allotted out of the basket`) allotted
    AND sum allotted AT MOST basket

-- The role hours a subject coordinator is given: what the principal
-- allotted him, an hour at most. They come in place of frontal hours
-- (§17's table keeps them within the frontal hours he must still teach).
@ref akn:art_41 akn:art_41/p2
GIVEN `allotted him out of the basket` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the role hours section 41 gives a subject coordinator` `allotted him out of the basket` IS
    min `allotted him out of the basket` `the most a subject coordinator is allotted out of the basket`

§§ `41 -- illustrations`

-- A four-year school of 4 classes in grade ט' and 12 in י'–י"ב: 8 hours;
-- a six-year school counts only its י'–י"ב: 6.
#ASSERT `the subject coordinators' basket of role hours` `a four-year school, grades 9 to 12` 4 12 EQUALS 8
#ASSERT `the subject coordinators' basket of role hours` `a six-year school, grades 7 to 12` 4 12 EQUALS 6
#ASSERT `section 41 allots role hours in` `the school year 5772` AND NOT `section 41 allots role hours in` 2010
-- six coordinators of an hour each fit a basket of 6; one of an hour and a
-- half does not, nor do seven hours in all
#ASSERT `an allotment within section 41` 6 (LIST 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1)
#ASSERT NOT `an allotment within section 41` 6 (LIST 1.5, 1, 1)
#ASSERT NOT `an allotment within section 41` 6 (LIST 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1)
#ASSERT `the role hours section 41 gives a subject coordinator` 0.5 EQUALS 0.5 AND `the role hours section 41 gives a subject coordinator` 2 EQUALS 1
